    "en": "PROPOSED, not exported. Thorax-abdomen 3D add-on: the muscles of this chapter that the bundled demo model lacks. Waiting for gui's yes (AN-43). The file is not named atlas-addon.json on purpose: CI treats that name as an exported add-on and checks its GLB. Source object names were read from the pinned Z-Anatomy Startup.blend on 2026-11-28. The source has no separate puborectalis mesh, so puborectalis stays a model gap. After approval: rename to atlas-addon.json, run site/build/atlas/build-addon.py thorax-abdomen, then write the position checks from the measured meshes and map the muscles in topic.json.",
